{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULLY. DESTRUCTIBLE. TRACK.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your missiles to carve new paths through any wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bombs to blow holes in the track, making it harder for your opponents....and you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/do_bomb.gif?t=1742845397\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTI-PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and up to 12 friends can race, destroy, and obliterate to place 1st</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the self-destruct timer, finding and optimizing your own paths of ruin is the only way to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STRATEGIZE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover or destroy the shortcuts created</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are your  skills better at racing around the track naturally?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create even tighter corners to take around the race track, or just blast your way right through the middle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/do_missile.gif?t=1742845397\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVELS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several tracks to race on, destroy, as well as create and discover new paths to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-level tracks to add even more height to the chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various track sizes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smaller tracks with higher levels of chaos and destruction, for more arena combat style gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bigger / longer tracks for more racing style gameplay</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins while racing, these coins can be used in the shop to purchase customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization's include changing your vehicles paint color, paint type, and decals</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593060?t=1742845397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/a2002fac75419b91519bff5b6f22da6a8adf745e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742845397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/7c144a49be9ae167da08fd3b057f858e37ec2aa0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742845397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/7c144a49be9ae167da08fd3b057f858e37ec2aa0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742845397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FULLY. DESTRUCTIBLE. TRACK.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your missiles to carve new paths through any wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bombs to blow holes in the track, making it harder for your opponents....and you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593060/extras/do_bomb.gif?t=1742845397\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTI-PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and up to 12 friends can race, destroy, and ob